<%# Receipt processed — show the QR code to staff.
    Staff present this QR code to the customer (on screen or printed).
    The customer scans it with their phone camera which opens WhatsApp
    and starts the cashback claim conversation with the R2R bot. %>

<h2>Receipt Processed Successfully</h2>

<p><strong>Bill total:</strong> £<%= @transaction.bill_total %></p>
<p><strong>Cashback earned (10%):</strong> £<%= @transaction.cashback_amount %></p>
<p><em>This QR code expires in 24 hours and can only be scanned once.</em></p>

<h3>Show this QR code to the customer:</h3>

<%# The QR code is stored as a Base64-encoded PNG in the database.
    We embed it directly in the img tag — no separate image file needed. %>
<%= image_tag @qr_token.qr_png_base64, style: "width: 250px; height: 250px;",
    alt: "Customer cashback QR code" %>

<br><br>
<%= link_to "Process another receipt", new_transaction_path %>